<!--
  The header's refresh control.

  The two-arrow circular "sync" glyph rather than a single clockwise arrow: a lone arc is
  ambiguous about which way it goes and reads as a spinner (this widget already has one, and a
  control that looks like the loading indicator is a control the user waits on instead of
  pressing). Drawn as a vector for the same reason as ic_today.xml — it is always drawn through a
  ColorFilter, so it needs no night-mode copy of its own.
-->
